meta {
  name: beer-vote
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  # beer-vote

  In-memory voting API for the k8s language meetup.

  ## Flow
  1. `Health` → check runtime
  2. `Beers / List Beers` → nominees 1..10
  3. `Users / Create User` → saves `userId` into the active environment
  4. `Votes / Create Vote` → uses `{{userId}}`
  5. `Results / Get Results` → online tally

  Switch `baseUrl` via environments (Local by default, port 8080).
}
